---
<div class="phone" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="phone-header">
    <div class="phone-avatar">MR</div>
    <div>
      <div class="phone-name">Maria Ruiz</div>
      <div class="phone-sub">(415) 555-0182 · 2 min ago</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="bubbles">
    <div class="bubble bubble-in">Hey, do you do weekly lawn service? My yard is a mess after the storm.</div>
    <div class="bubble bubble-out">Yeah I can help. How big is the yard?</div>
    <div class="bubble bubble-in">About a quarter acre. When could you swing by?</div>
  </div>

  <div class="ai-card">
    <div class="ai-head">
      <span class="ai-dot"></span>
      <span class="ai-label">AI Draft Reply</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-body">Could probably make it Thursday morning. Want me to swing by around 9?</div>
    <div class="ai-actions">
      <button class="ai-btn ai-btn-edit">Edit</button>
      <button class="ai-btn ai-btn-send">Send</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
